# GitHub 語言統計：第三方檔案不計入（xterm.js、ConPTY 二進位、字型）
xterm/** linguist-vendored
conpty/** linguist-vendored
assets/** linguist-vendored
# backend_*.inc 是被 backend.cpp #include 的 C++ 片段
*.inc linguist-language=C++
*.h linguist-language=C++
# 文字檔一律以 LF 儲存，避免 Windows 換行造成整檔差異
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.ttf binary
